:: Park Pumpkin Practise
<<effects>><<set _kylarLocation to getKylarLocation()>>

You take a seat at the pumpkin carving table, and get to work, carving away while watching the approach of other people up and down the table.
<br><br>

<<if _kylarLocation.area is "park" and $halloween_pumpkin_kylar is "win">>
	You feel Kylar's eyes on you the whole time, watching you across the park.
	<br><br>
<<elseif _kylarLocation.area is "park" and $halloween_pumpkin_kylar is "kylar">>
	Kylar sits beside you, outputting jack-o'-lantern after jack-o'-lantern at tremendous speed. Most are bad, but the sheer volume astounds onlookers.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

Practice Progress: <<print ($pumpkin_carving * 10)>>%
<br><br>

<<set _pumpkin_carving to ($pumpkin_carving + ($pumpkin_carving_knowledge?.length * 5))>>

<<pumpkin_prop>>

<<if $pumpkin_carving gte 10>>
	<span class="gold">You feel like you've learned a lot about pumpkin carving, all you can from practice here.</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="green">Your skill at pumpkin carving has improved.</span>
<</if>>

<<if _pumpkin_carving is 15>>
	<span class="gold">You've gained the Knowledge: Pumpkin Carving trait.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Park Pumpkin Competition
<<effects>><<set _kylarLocation to getKylarLocation()>>


<<if !$halloween_pumpkin>>
	You approach the pumpkin carving tables, all set up for the annual competition.
	<br><br>
	<<set $halloween_pumpkin to 1>>
	<<set $halloween_pumpkins_bought to 0>>
	<<set $pumpkin_carving to 0>>
	<<set $pumpkin_carving_knowledge to []>>
<</if>>

<<generate1>><<person1>><<generate2>>
<<if C.npc.Kylar.state isnot "prison" and $halloween_pumpkin_kylar>>
	<<npc Kylar 3>>
	You take your seat among the other competitors. Kylar appears beside you.
<<else>>
	You take your seat alongside the other competitors. 
<</if>>
A crowd gathers to watch, and a <<person>> dressed in a smart outfit steps onto a raised platform. <<He>> taps the microphone.
<br><br>

"Welcome to the annual Halloween pumpkin carving competition," <<he>> says. You hear <<his>> voice repeated through speakers in other parts of the park. <<He>> glances at <<his>> watch. "Without further ado, on the count of three. One. Two."
<br>
<<He>> raises <<his>> arms to encourage the crowd to join in.
<br>
"Three!"
<br><br>

<<link [[Begin|Park Pumpkin Competition 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Pumpkin Competition 2
<<effects>><<set _kylarLocation to getKylarLocation()>>

A knife has been provided, a long, thin blade, as well as a selection of stencils. You get to work, carving to the best of your ability.
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Kylar.state isnot "prison" and $halloween_pumpkin_kylar is "win">>
	Beside you, Kylar flicks bits of pumpkin at the other competitors, distracting them.
<<elseif C.npc.Kylar.state isnot "prison" and $halloween_pumpkin_kylar is "kylar">>
	<<person3>>Kylar carves beside you. In contrast with <<his>> previous energy, <<hes>> now slow, methodical, sparing no unnecessary movements. <<He>> leans over the pumpkin, concealing it from view.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Victory Chance:
<br>
Practical skill:
<<if $pumpkin_carving gte 10>>
	<span class="green">S</span>
<<elseif $pumpkin_carving gte 8>>
	<span class="lblue">A</span>
<<elseif $pumpkin_carving gte 6>>
	<span class="blue">B</span>
<<elseif $pumpkin_carving gte 4>>
	<span class="purple">C</span>
<<elseif $pumpkin_carving gte 1>>
	<span class="pink">D</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">F</span>
<</if>>
<br>
Knowledge: 
<<if $pumpkin_carving_knowledge?.length gte 2>>
	<span class="green">S</span>
<<elseif $pumpkin_carving_knowledge?.length gte 1>>
	<span class="blue">B</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">F</span> 
<</if>>
<<set $pumpkin_win_chance to (($pumpkin_carving + ($pumpkin_carving_knowledge?.length * 5)) / 15 * 100)>>
