:: Park Pumpkin Competition Won
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<earnFeat "Pumpkin Master">>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
<<set $halloween_pumpkin_competition to "won">>
The judge reaches the end of the tables, then turns and walks the way <<he>> came. <<He>> scoops up your jack-o'-lantern, and lifts it above <<his>> head. <span class="green">"We have our winner!"</span><<ggcontrol>><<lltrauma>><<llstress>><<control 25>><<trauma -12>><<stress -12>><<famebusiness 30>>
<br><br>

A great cheer rises, followed by applause, though you notice a few of the other contestants casting jealous glances your way. The <<person>> ushers you up front to pose for a photograph, and makes a show of handing you your prize.
<br><br>

<span class="gold">You've made <<moneyGain 1000>>.</span>
<br><br>

A crowd gathers around you.
<br><br>
"Your pumpkin is wonderful."
<br>
"What's your secret?"
<br>
"Is there a trick to it? Mine looks like a mauled potato."
<br><br>
What do you tell them?
<br><br>

<<link [[Be coy, and keep your secrets close|Park Pumpkin Competition Coy]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Say it's all about practice|Park Pumpkin Competition Practise]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $pumpkin_carving_knowledge.includes("library")>>
	<<link [[Say reading about the subject is important|Park Pumpkin Competition Library]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $pumpkin_carving_knowledge.includes("scriptorium")>>
	<<link [[Say knowing history is important|Park Pumpkin Competition Scriptorium]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>



:: Park Pumpkin Competition Coy
<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
You give nothing away. People badger you for a while, but respect your silence in the end. The crowd clears as people arrive to clean up the mess, and make sure all the knives are accounted for.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<unset $pumpkin_win_chance>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Pumpkin Competition Practise
<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
You tell people it's about practice. They nod along with your words, but some seem disappointed there's no trick to it. The crowd clears as people arrive to clean up the mess, and make sure all the knives are accounted for.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<unset $pumpkin_win_chance>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Pumpkin Competition Library
<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
You tell people to seek wisdom about the subject in books, and say you got pumpkin carving tips from the school library. Some are satisfied, though others don't seem keen on reading at all. The crowd clears as people arrive to clean up the mess, and make sure all the knives are accounted for.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<unset $pumpkin_win_chance>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Pumpkin Competition Scriptorium
<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
You tell people knowing the origins of things, how they developed, can be helpful. Some are satisfied, but some seem confused about what you mean. The crowd clears as people arrive to clean up the mess, and make sure all the knives are accounted for.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<unset $pumpkin_win_chance>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Pumpkin Competition Kylar
<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
<<set $halloween_pumpkin_competition to "kylar">>
"Come on," the <<person1>><<person>> says, amused. "It can't be that bad. If you're shy, just let me have a peek. No one else needs to see. You can't win if I can't see it."
<br><br>

Reluctant, Kylar shifts just enough for the <<person1>><<person>> to get a glimpse. <<He>> nods, then moves on.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park Pumpkin Competition Kylar 2]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Park Pumpkin Competition Kylar 2
<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
The judge reaches the end of the tables, then turns and walks the way <<he>> came. <span class="blue"><<He>> stops before reaching you.</span> Both arms reach out, and <<he>> scoops a wild-eyed Kylar up and away from <<person3>><<his>> jack-o'-lantern.
<br><br>

The crowd hushes as everyone beholds Kylar's work. It's unmistakable. The pumpkin is carved in your likeness. Your face flushes.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>

"Our winner," the <<person1>><<person>> announces. <<He>> seems to consider holding Kylar in the air, but decides against it, placing <<person3>><<him>> down beside <<his>> work.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park Pumpkin Competition Kylar 3]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Park Pumpkin Competition Kylar 3
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Kylar")>>
<<earnFeat "Pumpkin Master">>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
"And what have we here?" the <<person1>><<person>> continues, stepping next to you. "Why, it looks like the winner's muse." A murmur from the crowd.
<<if _kylarStatus.includes("Love")>>
	Kylar climbs over the table, and snatches the microphone. "Yes!" <<person3>><<he>> says, climbing back over the table to grasp your arm. "That's my <<girlfriend>>."
	<br><br>
	Most of the audience seem to find it sweet, but those your age whisper and smirk.<<llcool>><<ggstress>><<status -3>><<stress 12>>
	<br><br>
	The <<person1>><<person>> snatches the microphone back, and recovers <<person1>><<his>> composure, gesturing for photographers to approach. <<He>> makes a show of handing Kylar the prize money, who makes a show of handing it to you.
	<br><br>

	<span class="gold">You've made <<moneyGain 1000>>.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Park Pumpkin Competition Kylar High]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Kylar buries <<person3>><<his>> face in <<his>> arms once more, but you glimpse a smile.
	<br><br>

	The <<person1>><<person>> gestures for the photographers to approach. <<He>> considers Kylar a moment, then elects to hand the prize money to you. <<He>>'s keen to be photographed doing so.
	<br><br>

	<span class="gold">You've made <<moneyGain 1000>>.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Park Pumpkin Competition Kylar Low]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>



:: Park Pumpkin Competition Kylar High
<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
